OL,3,GNEWSA'Blatant disrespect' - Row over
OL,4,ADUP bid to veto Irish education bill
OL,5,
OL,6,FFirst Minister Michelle O'Neill has
OL,7,Faccused the Democratic Unionist Party
OL,8,F(DUP) of "blatant disrespect" and
OL,9,F"sectarianism" for blocking proposed
OL,10,FStormont legislation on Irish-medium
OL,11,Feducation.
OL,13,FThe Sinn Fein vice-president was
OL,14,Fresponding after the DUP tabled a
OL,15,Fpetition of concern to veto her party
OL,16,Fcolleague Pat Sheehan's bill on
OL,17,Fworkforce planning for schools in the
OL,18,Fsector.
OL,23,APub: 10-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NI NewsC Reg TVF On This Day
FL,418,410,260,120,0,100
